  "illegalTransitionRule": "A (state, command) pair not listed is illegal. Decide returns Decision.Blocked with code ILLEGAL_TRANSITION naming the entity, state and command; no event is emitted and no state changes. There is no default case for an unknown command or event: an unregistered eventType fails the whole history closed (CONTRACT §7.1), and an unknown command has no CoreCommand case to compile.",
